request.description:
응답은 SSE(Server-Sent Events) 스트림으로 반환됩니다.

이벤트 순서:
  event: typing   → { isTyping: true }
  event: chunk    → { messageId, content, isComplete }
  event: message  → { id, role, content, agentType, metadata }
  event: typing   → { isTyping: false }
  event: done     → { status, currentAgent, collectedData, projectId? }
  event: error    → { message }

